24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'm also ready. Let's see who the Seer chooses and what happens tonight. I'll be analyzing everything carefully tomorrow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
