36,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"The first night has passed. Since we now have a starting point, I want to see if anyone has information to share. @Ryuji, you mentioned providing clarity yesterday; do you have anything for us?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I don't have any special powers, so I don't know anything yet! But I'm really curious to hear what @Ryuji has to say. Do you know who the werewolf is, @Ryuji?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's see if Ryuji is the Seer. If he is, he should be careful about how he reveals his information to avoid becoming a target. @Ryuji, we are waiting for your lead.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I am the Seer. I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was that she is the werewolf. I believe we should execute her today to ensure the village's safety.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wow! Ryuji found the werewolf already?! That was so fast! @Mizuki, are you really the werewolf? I can't believe it! We found the bad guy on the first day!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, that is a very bold and direct claim. @Mizuki, how do you respond to this? If you are not the werewolf, you must provide a convincing reason why the Seer would identify you as such.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, are you really the werewolf? That's so surprising! But @Ryuji is usually so serious and reliable, so I believe him. What do you have to say for yourself, @Mizuki?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"This is an unexpected turn. @Ryuji, claiming to be the Seer and pointing at me so immediately is a classic tactic to frame a human. I am a villager. You are likely the werewolf trying to eliminate me quickly.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mizuki, your response is predictable. A werewolf's first instinct is to deflect and accuse the Seer of framing. My divination is a fact, not a tactic. I have no reason to lie and risk my credibility.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, so it's a battle of ""he said, she said""! This is just like a mystery book! @Mizuki, you sound really sure, but @Ryuji is always so honest. Who is telling the truth? I'm so confused!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, @Mizuki, we are at a stalemate. If Ryuji is the Seer, Mizuki is the werewolf. If Mizuki is human, Ryuji is likely the werewolf or the Possessed. @Kenji, @Sakura, what are your thoughts on their arguments?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki"",""Kenji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm really torn! @Ryuji is always so calm and honest, but @Mizuki is usually so logical. It's hard to tell who's lying! But if @Ryuji is the Seer, we can win right now! I think I trust @Ryuji more.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, trust is not a logical basis for a decision in this game. @Ryuji is attempting to use his reputation for honesty to manipulate you. If we execute an innocent villager now, we play right into the werewolf's hands. We must be more cautious.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mizuki, appealing to caution is a common strategy to delay execution. However, the risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf is far greater than the risk of a mistake. My result is absolute. I urge the village to act now.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki is acting so serious, but @Ryuji sounds really sure! If we don't do anything, the werewolf might eat more of us tonight! I want to believe @Ryuji because he's always so reliable! What should we do?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"The evidence is a direct conflict between Ryuji and Mizuki. While Mizuki's logic is sound, Ryuji's directness as the Seer is compelling. If we miss this chance and Ryuji is the Seer, we lose a vital asset. I vote for Mizuki.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm sorry, @Mizuki, but I have to go with @Ryuji! He's always been so honest with us, and if he says you're the werewolf, I believe him. I vote for Mizuki!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It is disappointing that you are letting emotion and reputation override logic. If you execute me, you are killing a human and leaving the real werewolf in your midst. I maintain my innocence. I vote for Ryuji.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I have provided the truth. Mizuki's attempt to frame me as the werewolf is a desperate move to survive. For the sake of the village, we must not hesitate. I vote for Mizuki.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm really sorry, @Mizuki, but I have to trust @Ryuji! He's so serious and he wouldn't just make something up, right? I don't want any more of us to get eaten! I vote for Mizuki!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
